Authored interpretation of captured source and receipts. No new training, benchmark, lineage or scientific promotion is implied.

**Method.** Three bias-free replicated 3³ convolutions, channels 1→4→4→1, with 648 learned F32 coefficients and a fixed residual skip q/8. All layers are linear; F32 execution order remains relevant even when a combined mathematical stencil exists. The input is the normalized physical residual q=(rho/h)r; the F64 reconstructed local pressure correction is cell-zero gauged and added to supplied base pressure. The captured predict_pressure function performs this local readout only; it does not run a V-cycle, GCR, advection or a full simulation advance.

**Purpose.** Add 12 manufactured spatial-band parent groups to post-coarse training to vary pressure spectra; these are independent patterns, not 12 additional fluid trajectories.

**Experiment.** 2,400 CUDA Adam updates, batch one, clip norm one; fine rate 0.001 with captured late drops. There are 46 parent groups / 92 saved examples, all train-only. The sampler preserves 1,600 small draws and interleaves 800 larger-tier draws; exact parent/frame exposures and voxel work verify. Grids extend through 128³ at 8/16/32 cells per metre, with fixed dt=1/60 s and fluid density 1,000 kg/m³. Before fitting, the source materializes one frozen CPU numerical V-cycle for each of the 92 saved frames, replacing base/residual while retaining original reference pressure and RHS labels. This preprocessing is outside the learned graph. Twelve added parent groups contain 24 independently manufactured cosine-mode pressure patterns across four shapes and three spatial bands. Their frame/time slots do not denote evolved fluid trajectories. The local objective weights pressure 0.25, pressure-gradient 0.25, equation 0.4 and spatial maximum-equation 0.1, plus log1p(relative equation squared/1e-12). Captured learning work is 2,400 root neural forwards / 605,205,500 input voxels; inherited auxiliary banks and the old teacher are inactive.

**Observed outcome.** Retained final logged training loss 26.89809763640584. The existing common 128-request result has worst mean-free pressure relative L2 0.23105797656320259, equation relative L2 0.10394945554794317 and GPU median of case-median pressure calls 0.75382274999999999 ms. Scope: Local smoother only on the common raw requests. Numerical hierarchy/GCR composition is excluded and requires a separate complete-solver benchmark. Timings include host-owned input/output, validation/packing, transfers and synchronization for the captured readout, with setup/scoring separate. These are retained consumed small-grid cases, not independent large-grid or trajectory results. No new model execution occurs here.

**Lesson.** Manufactured spatial spectra broaden component supervision without extending simulated physical duration or independent fluid-scene count. The common benchmark still measures the local predictor on raw requests; evaluate its intended numerical composition separately.

**Reproduction.** Retain the exact typed native recipe, all witnessed source/config/runtime, fixed normalization, complete original input packet, source population and initial/final tensors. Preserve balanced private RNG streams, physical parent/frame counts and final-update selection. Retain native augmentation receipts or manufactured-pattern generator as applicable; post-coarse and differentiable hierarchy training require their exact numerical arithmetic and gauge/adjoint. The historical wrapper/restore runs CPU neural inference and needs a qualified GPU-only route before replay. Clean retraining, new-Rheon regeneration, complete-composition benchmarking and drift remain unqualified; no historical Trial ancestry is invented.

